OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FNewcastle and Liverpool paid a moving
OL,8,Ftribute to Kevin Keegan ahead of their
OL,9,FPremier League campaign opener at St
OL,10,FJames' Park on Sunday.
OL,12,FKeegan, who played for both clubs
OL,13,Fbefore going on to manage Newcastle
OL,14,Ffrom 1992 to 1997 and then again
OL,15,Fbriefly in 2008, died aged 75 on July
OL,16,F20 following a short battle with
OL,17,Fstomach cancer.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
