FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FMembers of Keegan's family were in the
OL,8,Fdirectors' box, as were many of his
OL,9,Fformer players during his first stint
OL,10,Fat Newcastle, including Alan Shearer,
OL,11,FPeter Beardsley and Faustino Asprilla.
OL,13,FBoth Newcastle and Liverpool players
OL,14,Fwarmed up with 'Keegan 7 emblazoned
OL,15,Fon the back of their shirts, while a
OL,16,Fgiant mosaic made from tributes that
OL,17,Fwere left outside St James' Park
OL,18,Ffollowing the death of the former
OL,19,FEngland captain was displayed on the
OL,20,Fcentre circle before kick-off.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FFan group Wor Flags created a display
OL,8,Fwhich involved all seats inside the
OL,9,Fstadium, with 'Keegan 7' spelt out in
OL,10,Fthe Leazes End and there was a tifo of
OL,11,F'King Kev' in the East Stand.
OL,13,FThe teams and supporters then united
OL,14,Fin a one-minute applause ahead of kick-
OL,15,Foff before the chant "there's only one
OL,16,FKevin Keegan" erupted from the stands.
OL,26,@wD@VOUxD@MO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
