CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,FA letter from the Keegan family
OL,8,Freleased ahead of the match said:
OL,9,F"Despite living outside of the region,
OL,10,Fyour love and warmth from the North
OL,11,FEast has reached our hearts and filled
OL,12,Fus with so much comfort during these
OL,13,Fdifficult days.
OL,15,F"The empathy, compassion and warmth of
OL,16,Fthis extraordinary club and community
OL,17,Fhave shone through; the outpouring of
OL,18,Flove has been truly overwhelming.
OL,26,@qD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,F"Having seen the tributes outside St.
OL,8,FJames' Park, members of our family
OL,9,Fcame home to Newcastle to see the
OL,10,Fmemorials in person. The sea of black
OL,11,Fand white shirts and scarves,
OL,12,Falongside colours from so many other
OL,13,Fclubs, reminded us how much Kevin
OL,14,Fmeant to the footballing world.
OL,16,F"It was a sombre moment that reminded
OL,17,Fus of our pain and loss, yet matched
OL,18,Fwith immense pride and love as we read
OL,19,Fso many personal and heartfelt
OL,20,Fmessages.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,F"Kevin always shared his love for
OL,8,FNewcastle United, Geordies, and the
OL,9,Fcity, captivating us with stories told
OL,10,Fwith his infectious smile. Seeing
OL,11,Fthese tributes brought those stories
OL,12,Fto life for Kevin's grandchildren,
OL,13,Fshowing them how deeply their
OL,14,Fgrandfather was loved in return.
OL,16,F"It also allowed us a quiet moment to
OL,17,Freflect on many fond memories of
OL,18,FKevin's incredible career and the
OL,19,Fincomparable bond he shared with
OL,20,FNewcastle.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,307,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1787617146
OL,3,CNewcastle and Liverpool pay tribute to
OL,4,CKevin Keegan ahead of St James' Park
OL,5,Cgame
OL,7,F"Your football club, city, and
OL,8,Fcommunity show a passion that truly
OL,9,Fembodied Kevin as a footballer,
OL,10,Fmanager, and family man. We will be
OL,11,Feternally grateful for the adoration
OL,12,Fand strength you have given our family
OL,13,Fwhen we needed it most.
OL,15,F"Newcastle, thank you for your love."
